      "text": "Wuthering Waves EP2.2 - Cantarella «Elusive Seas/Mares Esquivos» ya está disponible en Spotify, Apple Music y otras plataformas.\n\n►Spotify: \nhttps://\nopen.spotify.com/album/1JfzXgXe\nm8amrf4HIzd7BW?si=D-x872uJSyGFvZwqjrUC8A\n…\n►Apple Music: \nhttps://\nmusic.apple.com/es/album/elusi\nve-seas-ep/1806258927\n…\n\n#WutheringWaves #Cantarella",
